Changes in v6:
- Fix dw_i3c_ccc_set() to use dw_i3c_ccc_map_err() so SET CCCs get the
  same M0/M2 mapping as GET.

Changes in v5:
- Unchanged from v4 patch 2/3.
- Add Reviewed-by: Alexandre Mergnat <amergnat@baylibre.com>.
