HP ZBook 8 G2a 14 and 16 (SSIDs 0x103c:0x8f94 and 0x103c:0x8f95)
require special handling for the speaker mute LED with inverted
behavior compared to the existing ALC245_FIXUP_HP_TAS2781_I2C_MUTE_LED.

